<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Mercedes (1981) relet 120,000 long tons Richards Bay/Rotterdam July $5.95 fio scale load/25,000 shinc Preg.</p>
<p>ORE - Doceriver (1986) 150,000 long tons Cape Lambert/Redcar early-July $7.25 fio six days shinc British Steel.</p>
